; Acroloc homing program (install as c:\cncm\cncm.hom on the control PC)
; Home order: Z plus first (clear the head), then X minus, then Y plus.
M92/Z
M26/Z
M91/X
M26/X
M92/Y
M26/Y
; Acroloc: every axis now sits exactly at machine zero. Pulse HomeSync_SV
; (SV_M94_M95_6) so the PLC latches the encoder counts here; the VCP
; machine-coordinate readout measures from this latch.
M94 /6
G4 P0.25
M95 /6
